## Promotion / Demotion Guidelines

If this rule does not seem to be working, consider:

- **Can it be enforced at a lower layer?** (Promote L1 → L3-L5)
- **Is it only needed for specific tasks?** (Demote Rule → Skill)
- **Is it no longer needed?** (Demotion decision at quarterly review)

