## Checklist When Creating a Rule

- [ ] Is it required for all tasks? → If No, demote it to a Skill
- [ ] Can it be enforced at L5 (compiler/lint)? → If yes, keep the rule description minimal and rely on L5
- [ ] Is it written so that violation/compliance is decidable? (Vague rules cause false negatives at L2)
- [ ] Does it overlap in responsibility with an existing Rule?
- [ ] Is the ID Prefix unique within INDEX.md?
